00:00:00,260 --> 00:00:03,100
(Transcribed by TurboScribe. Go Unlimited to remove this message.) Austin goes to a private school.

2
00:00:04,080 --> 00:00:07,680
Private schools make their students wear uniforms.

3
00:00:08,920 --> 00:00:10,780
Austin hates the uniform.

4
00:00:11,780 --> 00:00:14,320
He has his own unique style.

5
00:00:15,340 --> 00:00:18,360
One day, he decided to break the rules.

6
00:00:19,080 --> 00:00:21,260
He wore a baseball cap to school.

7
00:00:22,160 --> 00:00:23,980
His teacher noticed his cap.

8
00:00:24,700 --> 00:00:26,640
She told him to take it off.

9
00:00:27,520 --> 00:00:29,280
Austin asks why.

10
00:00:30,020 --> 00:00:34,140
We can't tell if you're sleeping, Ms. Myers

11
00:00:34,140 --> 00:00:34,660
said.

12
00:00:35,220 --> 00:00:37,320
Fine, Austin yelled.

13
00:00:37,860 --> 00:00:39,160
He took off his cap.

14
00:00:39,760 --> 00:00:42,640
He threw his cap at Ms. Myers.

15
00:00:43,740 --> 00:00:47,140
Austin, your behavior is unacceptable.

16
00:00:48,220 --> 00:00:51,160
He was sent to the principal's office.

17
00:00:52,080 --> 00:00:54,720
He was forced to go home.

18
00:00:55,660 --> 00:00:59,320
His parents grounded him for a week.
